Partiduo connect is the identity provider shared by every Partiduo
instance and by the fleet administration (aloli-partiduo/partiduo-admin,
ADR-012): one account per person, with one passkey, one authenticator app
and one set of recovery codes, whatever the number of instances. It speaks
OpenID Connect (authorization code with PKCE, ES256 ID tokens, back-channel
logout); each instance keeps deciding who gets in and with which rights.

This package installs the web application (partiduo-connect), its command
line (partiduo-connect-manage) and the rc.d script partiduo_connect.
